---
description: Semantic color token convention for Tailwind + shadcn
alwaysApply: false
globs: src/**/*.tsx, src/**/*.css
---

## Three-layer token system

1. **Semantic tokens** (`--{role}`) in `src/styles/theme-tokens.css` — never reference directly in TSX
2. **Tailwind mappings** via `@theme inline` in `src/app/globals.css`
3. **Components** use Tailwind utilities only: `bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`, `sidebar-*`

## Forbidden in components
- Raw hex/rgb/oklch/hsl values
- `hsl(var(--*))` in className strings
- Arbitrary colors like `bg-[#fff]` or `text-blue-500`

## Adding new colors
Add tokens to `src/styles/theme-tokens.css` first, map in `src/app/globals.css` `@theme`, then use semantic Tailwind class.

See also: `nextjs-ui.mdc`
